==Statistics==
{{As of|2024|04|df=y}}, the only foreign operator to Gan is [[SriLankan Airlines]]<ref name=fr24>{{Cite web|url=https://www.flightradar24.com/data/airports/gan|title=GAN airport destinations|publisher=Flightradar24|access-date=13 April 2024}} Updated constantly.</ref> using [[Airbus A320 family|Airbus A320]] aircraft.

==Accidents and incidents==
*On 12 March 2019, a [[Maldivian (airline)#Fleet|Maldivian]] [[Bombardier Dash 8 Q300]] suffered a landing gear malfunction, due to which the plane circled around the airport for one hour.<ref name=":0">{{Cite news |date=13 March 2019 |title=Maldives airline apologises for plane's landing gear malfunction |url=https://maldivesindependent.com/society/maldives-airline-apologises-for-planes-landing-gear-malfunction-144212 |access-date=19 June 2024 |work=Maldives Independent}}</ref> The aircraft landed safely, but the landing gear was not fully retracted.<ref name=":0" /> This was the first incident to occur at Gan International Airport.

